[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0010","text":"你们俩，在看什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0020","text":"诶？　……啊——，那个\n只是我在看而已，这个────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0030","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0040","text":"让我看看……\n哦，猫咪视频啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0005","text":"有点像某个人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0006","text":"好可爱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_00_0007","text":"跟日花有点像啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_01_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_01_0020","text":"……制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_02_0010","text":"……看起来好软"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_02_0020","text":"对、对吧——！\n看起来超软的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_03_0010","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07020000_03_0020","text":"……诶，诶——！\n真的像吗，美琴小姐……！"}]
